            "slot": "s617",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I work a desk job and spend too much t…",
            "text": "I work a desk job and spend too much time sitting, often have lower back pain. Since I got this mattress, I have less lower back pain. The difference in pain level from when I go to sleep to when I wake up is noticeable - the mattress seems to actually relieve my pain. I used to share a SleepNumber with my ex and thought it was the best option out there but I stand corrected. Add that EarthFoam is ethically sourced and produced, surprisingly well priced, and a Consumer Reports Smart Buy, it’s the clear winner.",
